---

This repository is an orchestration WebUI. It does not bundle any TTS model or
inference engine: it calls an external audio.cpp server (Apache-2.0,
https://github.com/0xShug0/audio.cpp) whose models (e.g. OmniVoice by k2-fsa,
Apache-2.0) keep their own licenses. Sample books under sample-books/ are
public-domain works; see sample-books/LICENSES.md.
